{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beloved Playdate platformer is now available on Steam!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summit : Steps of Solace\u00a0</strong>is an exhilarating mountain climbing precision platformer, where you scale a relentless peak filled with brutal jumps, hazards, and shifting terrain. Master a range of tools to ascend higher, where every fall is a lesson and each hard-earned step gets you closer to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average story playthrough is about <strong>1-1.5 hours</strong> in length.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/6e6c76659de238ad2b7208129406ce81.poster.avif?t=1750352590\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/6e6c76659de238ad2b7208129406ce81.webm?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/6e6c76659de238ad2b7208129406ce81.mp4?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with 2 pickaxes, scale the mountain to reach the top. Avoid physics based environmental hazards as you uncover the story behind our protagonist\u2019s unwavering tenacity to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/26bc670c0fb66ded5c1b9f9a618c5954.poster.avif?t=1750352590\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/26bc670c0fb66ded5c1b9f9a618c5954.webm?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/26bc670c0fb66ded5c1b9f9a618c5954.mp4?t=1750352590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed run mode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collectibles\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will <strong>you</strong> reach the summit?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/2f405361fa9cfd6a31824d48fbce000faa64de5b.jpg"},{"name":"Summit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/ed600f29ea01c8d3bcc6ca19db1c49c959a4c6b2.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Ascent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/a36fc73cee489d3a46d8d7c5ee6255d0be3fd191.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/02c3d00e0c24fe6ab33ce47f20cfa379dbf30c0c.jpg"},{"name":"No Time To Breath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/6038aa1c2f20235c197ec2e813ce36c4fbc84b24.jpg"},{"name":"Take Flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/d7700d296191c4f996703fe7bcdaa50e4dd9d5fd.jpg"},{"name":"Out of Reach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850/4982e62e07a8617cabaf2bd88beaad4ba8e597b3.jpg"},{"name":"New Game+","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3534850